+# Aegis Full-Autonomy Gate Checklist
+
+Use this checklist to verify acceptance criteria before enabling broader automation.
+
+Generative
+- [ ] Verifier thresholds published from SME holdouts and stored in ConfigMap.
+- [ ] 30 days of shadow runs with divergence ≤ configured threshold for all gen endpoints.
+- [ ] Canary windows executed and passing automated canary evaluation for last 3 releases.
+- [ ] Tokenization parity & deterministic inference tests pass for all serving variants.
+
+Multimodal
+- [ ] Resumable ingest error rate < 2% under target throughput (load test).
+- [ ] Model repo lifecycle CI successfully packages and uploads models; Triton reload works.
+- [ ] Kernel tuner results validated on representative GPU nodes and baked into Triton configmap.
+- [ ] Perceptual metrics (SSIM/SNR) thresholds defined and passing in Tekton eval tasks.
+
+Agentic
+- [ ] Planner hallucination (schema failure) rate under threshold in dry-run campaigns.
+- [ ] Verified wrappers implemented for all side-effecting tools; idempotency assertions present.
+- [ ] RBAC integrated with IdP for user->roles and tested.
+- [ ] Simulator runs completed (>=1000 traces) with acceptable risk metrics.
+- [ ] MTTR drill passed (operator can rollback within target window).
+- [ ] Evidence manifests for action runs stored in evidence bucket with retention.
+
+Gate decision:
+- [ ] All items above checked and evidence archived -> approve enabling low-risk automated actions.
+
